# INVWINSC.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the search's
# results at levels 1 and 2.  At level 1 the search is allowed and ENTER shows
# a found item, while CTRL-E, INS and DEL are refused; Service records and
# Loans and holds show the item's service records and loans, whose ESC goes
# back to the results.  After a log-out, at level 2, a location's items: INS
# shows a new item on that location, which ESC leaves without asking, and
# CTRL-E edits the found item; a search cancelled from the menu leaves the
# results as they were; DEL, answered Yes, deletes the item, and the results
# fetched again are empty.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINSC.SNP is its snapshot.
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER
K ALT-S T
T IBM
K ENTER
S FOUND
K ENTER
S VIEW
K ENTER CTRL-E
S NOEDIT
K ENTER INS
S NONEW
K ENTER DEL
S NODEL
K ENTER ALT-C S
S SERVICE
K ESC
S BACK
K ALT-C A
S LOANS
K ESC
S BACK2
K ESC ESC ALT-F L STAB
T CLERK
K TAB
T Clerk1986
K ENTER
K ALT-S F TAB
T B2
K ENTER
S CLERK
K INS
S NEW
K ESC
S NOASK
K CTRL-E
S EDIT
K ESC ALT-S T
T IBM
K ESC
S KEPT
K DEL
S DELQ
K Y
S DELETED
K ALT-F X
